[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7740.47, "timestamp": "02:09:00", "text": "上面写着“书一”的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7741.99, "timestamp": "02:09:01", "text": "比如说，如果你把鼠标悬停在上面，它应该会显示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7743.109, "timestamp": "02:09:03", "text": "咒语"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7746.31, "timestamp": "02:09:06", "text": "你可以应用它，你可以准备你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7749.03, "timestamp": "02:09:09", "text": "那里有咒语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7750.47, "timestamp": "02:09:10", "text": "你可以每次都更改它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7753.03, "timestamp": "02:09:13", "text": "每次休息的时候。所以，别担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7754.79, "timestamp": "02:09:14", "text": "关于准备工作的事情太多了。但是你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7756.229, "timestamp": "02:09:16", "text": "准备其中九份。请随意挑选"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7757.589, "timestamp": "02:09:17", "text": "任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7758.629, "timestamp": "02:09:18", "text": "我会查一下你是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7761.43, "timestamp": "02:09:21", "text": "什么是第二级、第二级和第三级？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7762.229, "timestamp": "02:09:22", "text": "等级？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7766.709, "timestamp": "02:09:26", "text": "哦，好的。所以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7769.75, "timestamp": "02:09:29", "text": "呃，法术等级就是你拥有法术的能力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7773.91, "timestamp": "02:09:33", "text": "对应于 um 的插槽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7775.43, "timestamp": "02:09:35", "text": "哦，这水平。所以如果你看到类似这样的情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7776.87, "timestamp": "02:09:36", "text": "第一层，然后是侧面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7779.27, "timestamp": "02:09:39", "text": "就像五边形一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7781.109, "timestamp": "02:09:41", "text": "旁边的东西。如果你将鼠标悬停在上面，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7782.39, "timestamp": "02:09:42", "text": "它会显示第一、第二、第三和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7785.109, "timestamp": "02:09:45", "text": "第四个法术位。那就是你的法力值。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7789.109, "timestamp": "02:09:49", "text": "每个法术等级都需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7791.669, "timestamp": "02:09:51", "text": "本质上是不同层次的魔法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7792.7, "timestamp": "02:09:52", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7794.55, "timestamp": "02:09:54", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7797.91, "timestamp": "02:09:57", "text": "所以，呃，就像在这里你可以做事情。"}]